{"4120660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Last Orders", "steam_appid": 4120660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last Orders is a first-person multiplayer encapsulation of British pub culture: sink pints, sing, dance, smoke, gamble, and get in fights. Get your friends together and prepare for the night out of your life! Last Order brings the reckless disregard for consequences that comes with copious alcohol consumption to your PC, complete with a healthy dose of silliness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join with upto 5 friends as part of an elite task force of Lesser Britain's most esteemed drinkers to complete noble tasks such as beating up pub-goers, gambling, and smoking unhealthy amounts of cigarettes, all in the name of saving your country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patrons of the bar have left mixed reviews:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120660/extras/2273f0cbd986f0bbf9fe292b967964cd.avif?t=1774478526\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★★☆☆☆ - horrible bartender, bald man (old). I came to Last Orders with some friends to have a boring night out, instead we walked into CESSPOOL of gambling, smoking, fighting, and other FAR TOO EXCITING adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120660/extras/83bfdedd57f18fa9dd4604be3e0a9da4.avif?t=1774478526\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★★★★☆ - last night i smoked 30 cigarettes, picked a fight with at least 4 different strangers, and uppercut one patron into the ceiling. i passed out and when i woke up all my money had been stolen. HIGHLY RECOMMEND.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120660/extras/c373d5ababda17fa80bffd2fee4cacc8.avif?t=1774478526\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★★★★★ - drank 14 shots of tequila and won £10,000 on the slots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity-based voice chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different bar environments for all tastes: quiet social club, cosy village pub, active city bar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic matchmaking for player-hosted lobbies for you and your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different player avatars to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flashy combat system for bar fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intoxication system which influences movement, combat, and general silliness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quest NPCs with special interactions, such as finding (or stealing) a lost wallet, beating up a big strong guy, getting a photographer to take photos of you, or purchasing illegal wares from a shady character.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last Orders is a first-person multiplayer encapsulation of British pub culture: sink pints, sing, dance, smoke, gamble, and get in fights. Get your friends together and prepare for the night out of your life! Last Order brings the reckless disregard for consequences that comes with copious alcohol consumption to your PC, complete with a healthy dose of silliness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join with upto 5 friends as part of an elite task force of Lesser Britain's most esteemed drinkers to complete noble tasks such as beating up pub-goers, gambling, and smoking unhealthy amounts of cigarettes, all in the name of saving your country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patrons of the bar have left mixed reviews:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120660/extras/2273f0cbd986f0bbf9fe292b967964cd.avif?t=1774478526\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★★☆☆☆ - horrible bartender, bald man (old). I came to Last Orders with some friends to have a boring night out, instead we walked into CESSPOOL of gambling, smoking, fighting, and other FAR TOO EXCITING adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120660/extras/83bfdedd57f18fa9dd4604be3e0a9da4.avif?t=1774478526\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★★★★☆ - last night i smoked 30 cigarettes, picked a fight with at least 4 different strangers, and uppercut one patron into the ceiling. i passed out and when i woke up all my money had been stolen. HIGHLY RECOMMEND.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120660/extras/c373d5ababda17fa80bffd2fee4cacc8.avif?t=1774478526\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★★★★★ - drank 14 shots of tequila and won £10,000 on the slots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity-based voice chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different bar environments for all tastes: quiet social club, cosy village pub, active city bar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic matchmaking for player-hosted lobbies for you and your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different player avatars to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flashy combat system for bar fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intoxication system which influences movement, combat, and general silliness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quest NPCs with special interactions, such as finding (or stealing) a lost wallet, beating up a big strong guy, getting a photographer to take photos of you, or purchasing illegal wares from a shady character.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Last Orders is a first-person multiplayer encapsulation of British pub culture: sink pints, sing, dance, smoke, gamble, and get in fights. Get your friends together and prepare for the night out of your life!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120660/d3a444a1156876ebec9075c353c8c4912f76e293/header.jpg?t=1774478526", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120660/7d20bfc9bd7b0615e80743891e86c453cb85284b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774478526", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120660/7d20bfc9bd7b0615e80743891e86c453cb85284b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774478526", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 3 3100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["peterkcodes"], "publishers": ["peterkcodes